      "title": "Colombia earthquake live updates: more than 100 dead and buildings collapsed after 7.4-magnitude quake",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/10/74-magnitude-earthquake-shakes-colombia-causing-serious-damage-latest-news",
      "description": "<p>More than a dozen buildings collapsed in aftermath of earthquake, which has also prompted evacuations</p><p><strong>People remain trapped in Cali, one of Colombia’s largest cities, ​after more than two dozen structures ‌collapsed, mayor Alejandro Eder said. ‌</strong></p><p>He added that the city had asked authorities in Bogota and Medellin to send disaster teams ‌to support rescue efforts.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/10/74-magnitude-earthquake-shakes-colombia-causing-serious-damage-latest-news\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-11T00:33:42"
    },
    {
      "title": "Scores dead after powerful earthquake strikes western Colombia",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/10/colombia-earthquake-cali-pereira-choco",
      "description": "<p>Quake of 7.4 magnitude collapses and severely damages buildings in several major cities, including Cali and Pereira</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/10/74-magnitude-earthquake-shakes-colombia-causing-serious-damage-latest-news\">Colombia earthquake live – latest updates</a></p></li></ul><p>More than 100 people have died after a powerful earthquake struck western Colombia, collapsing and severely damaging scores of buildings in major cities including Cali and Pereira.</p><p>The US and Colombian geological surveys reported that a 7.4-magnitude earthquake struck at 7.34am local time (13.34 BST) on Monday, with its epicentre in the western department of Chocó. It was also felt in neighbouring Venezuela, which is still reeling from a deadly double earthquake on 24 June.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/10/colombia-earthquake-cali-pereira-choco\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-10T18:11:06"
    },
